<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 8.0 bln SKR of T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 8.0 bln SKR of T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of 8.0 billion crowns worth of Treasury bills of two maturities.</p>
<p>The auction of six-month and one-year paper will be on October 23, it said. Bids are due at 1030 GMT on that day. The settlement date is October 25.</p>
